# Kanban widget — 5 design suggestions

Grounded in today's widget: enum-field columns, cards = title + up to 2 scalar
fields, drag-to-update writes the column value, plus config for column
subset/order, card fields, `includeArchived`, `showEmptyColumns`, `orderBy`.
Each suggestion below says what changes and which config it needs.

---

## 1 — Classic+ (polished evolution of today's board)

Same model, tighter chrome: colored dot from the enum's `optionColor`, count
chip right-aligned, drop-target glow on hover, inline "+ Add" that creates an
instance pre-set to that column.

```
╭──────────────╮ ╭──────────────╮ ╭──────────────╮ ╭──────────────╮
│ ● To Do    4 │ │ ● Doing    3 │ │ ● Review   2 │ │ ● Done     5 │
├──────────────┤ ├──────────────┤ ├──────────────┤ ├──────────────┤
│ ┌──────────┐ │ │ ┌──────────┐ │ │ ┌──────────┐ │ │ ┌──────────┐ │
│ │Fix login │ │ │ │Auth flow │ │ │ │API audit │ │ │ │Logo set  │ │
│ │acme · P1 │ │ │ │normain   │ │ │ │acme      │ │ │ │shipped   │ │
│ └──────────┘ │ │ └──────────┘ │ │ └──────────┘ │ │ └──────────┘ │
│ ┌──────────┐ │ │ ┌──────────┐ │ │              │ │              │
│ │Onboarding│ │ │ │Billing   │ │ │   (drop ↓)   │ │              │
│ └──────────┘ │ │ └──────────┘ │ │ ┌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┐ │ │              │
│  + Add       │ │              │ │ ╎ glow zone╎ │ │              │
╰──────────────╯ ╰──────────────╯ ╰──────────────╯ ╰──────────────╯
```

- **New:** inline add-card per column; header dot uses `optionColors`.
- **Config:** none beyond today. Lowest-effort, safest default.

