## 3 — Pipeline (value rollups + WIP limits)

For CRM/deal/vendor boards. Column header sums a money/number field and shows a
WIP bar; a board footer totals the pipeline. Limits are visual (warn, don't
block).

```
┌ Lead ─────────────┐ ┌ Qualified ────────┐ ┌ Negotiation ──────┐ ┌ Won ──────────────┐
│ 6 · $48k          │ │ 4 · $120k         │ │ 3 · $310k         │ │ 9 · $1.2M         │
│ WIP ███████░ 6/8  │ │ WIP ████░░░░ 4/10 │ │ WIP ██████ 3/3 ⚠  │ │ ─                 │
├───────────────────┤ ├───────────────────┤ ├───────────────────┤ ├───────────────────┤
│ Acme Corp    $12k │ │ Globex      $40k  │ │ Initech    $180k  │ │ Hooli      $600k  │
│ Umbrella     $8k  │ │ Stark       $35k  │ │ Wayne       $90k  │ │ Pied Piper $300k  │
│ Soylent      $6k  │ │ Cyberdyne   $25k  │ │ Tyrell      $40k  │ │ Massive    $180k  │
└───────────────────┘ └───────────────────┘ └───────────────────┘ └───────────────────┘
  Σ pipeline $1.68M  ·  open $478k  ·  won $1.2M
```

- **New:** `sumField` (money/number) → per-column total + board footer;
  `wipLimit` per column → bar + ⚠ over limit.
- **Config:** `sumField`, optional `wipLimits: Record<value, number>`.

