## 5 — Compact + collapsible (high-density spine)

One-line cards (no detail rows) and per-column collapse to a vertical title
spine. Built for many columns or a huge "Done" pile you want out of the way.
Collapsed state persists in the widget config.

```
 Expanded ─────────────────────────────────────   Collapsed ┐
┌ Backlog 12 ┐ ┌ Doing 5 ┐ ┌ Review 3 ┐ ┌─▸ Done ─┐
│ • Fix login│ │• Auth    │ │• Audit   │ │ D       │
│ • Onboard  │ │• Billing │ │• Perf    │ │ o       │
│ • Search   │ │• Imports │ │• i18n    │ │ n   28  │
│ • Export   │ │• Search  │ │          │ │ e       │
│ • Reports  │ │          │ │          │ │ ▸ click │
│ • …(7 more)│ │          │ │          │ │   to    │
└────────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └─ open ──┘
```

- **New:** `density: "compact" | "comfortable"`; per-column collapse toggle.
- **Config:** `density`, `collapsedColumns: string[]`.

