## Quick compare

| # | Direction        | Best for                     | New config                    | Effort |
|---|------------------|------------------------------|-------------------------------|--------|
| 1 | Classic+         | general task boards          | none                          | S      |
| 2 | Rich cards       | detail-heavy work items      | coverField/avatarField        | M      |
| 3 | Pipeline         | CRM / deals / vendors        | sumField, wipLimits           | M      |
| 4 | Swimlanes        | owner × status, team views   | swimlaneBy                    | L      |
| 5 | Compact+collapse | many columns / big backlogs  | density, collapsedColumns     | S–M    |
